    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Use [`BNNSBandPart(_:_:_:_:_:)`](bnnsbandpart(_:_:_:_:_:).md) to copy a tensor’s main diagonal and zero or more upper and lower bands.",
      "ko": "Use [`BNNSBandPart(_:_:_:_:_:)`](bnnsbandpart(_:_:_:_:_:).md) to copy a tensor’s main diagonal and zero or more upper and lower bands.",
      "sourceHash": "9d278e8ed4a129319cd79448bb9eae4399f86d9a73ee8e1b534b765e1b9e7ddc",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "You can specify that the function returns either the entire upper or lower triangle by passing a negative value to the corresponding `num_*` parameter.",
      "ko": "`num_*` 매개변수에 음수 값을 전달하면 함수가 전체 상삼각 또는 전체 하삼각을 반환하도록 지정할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "7cf426c3f97a330da48a41e6ccb1ad5ea91e1e2b8b5064627ac6aaa760879628",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "For example, given the following 8x8 matrix:",
      "ko": "예를 들어 다음 8×8 행렬이 주어집니다.",
      "sourceHash": "59e9b63b0bbb32e14f3e23038e8bc29e6e3f0c1b57ce01845d5c18e88b447361",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nlet matrixValues: [Float] = [ 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18,\n                              21, 22, 23, 24, 25, 26, 27, 28,\n                              31, 32, 33, 34, 35, 36, 37, 38,\n                              41, 42, 43, 44, 45, 46, 47, 48,\n                              51, 52, 53, 54, 55, 56, 57, 58,\n                              61, 62, 63, 64, 65, 66, 67, 68,\n                              71, 72, 73, 74, 75, 76, 77, 78,\n                              81, 82, 83, 84, 85, 86, 87, 88 ]\n\nvar inputDescriptor = BNNSNDArrayDescriptor.allocate(\n     initializingFrom: matrixValues,\n     shape: .matrixRowMajor(8, 8))\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nlet matrixValues: [Float] = [ 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18,\n                              21, 22, 23, 24, 25, 26, 27, 28,\n                              31, 32, 33, 34, 35, 36, 37, 38,\n                              41, 42, 43, 44, 45, 46, 47, 48,\n                              51, 52, 53, 54, 55, 56, 57, 58,\n                              61, 62, 63, 64, 65, 66, 67, 68,\n                              71, 72, 73, 74, 75, 76, 77, 78,\n                              81, 82, 83, 84, 85, 86, 87, 88 ]\n\nvar inputDescriptor = BNNSNDArrayDescriptor.allocate(\n     initializingFrom: matrixValues,\n     shape: .matrixRowMajor(8, 8))\n```",
      "sourceHash": "2b1bf3ca33cff22c8d4b9151b27623d2754543a6bc3d2a097e03e9c8254cfeba",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "The following code selects the upper triangle and sets other elements to zero:",
      "ko": "다음 코드는 상삼각을 선택하고 다른 요소를 0으로 설정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a7cbcc666a0a3ca2d88f5b38f4d16c8bd8eba4b5204587d8cfa9f4846019ffc6",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0012:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nvar outputDescriptor = BNNSNDArrayDescriptor.allocateUninitialized(\n    scalarType: Float.self,\n    shape: inputDescriptor.shape)\n\nBNNSBandPart(0,  // num_lower\n             -1, // num_upper\n             &inputDescriptor,\n             &outputDescriptor, nil)\n\nprintMatrix(outputDescriptor)\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nvar outputDescriptor = BNNSNDArrayDescriptor.allocateUninitialized(\n    scalarType: Float.self,\n    shape: inputDescriptor.shape)\n\nBNNSBandPart(0,  // num_lower\n             -1, // num_upper\n             &inputDescriptor,\n             &outputDescriptor, nil)\n\nprintMatrix(outputDescriptor)\n```",
      "sourceHash": "729e6fb76d07365408ec15df93e979b5b01658f0045e925c1c9b718d35f8d2ab",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
